---
// Features:Bento 布局 4 个核心卖点
---

<section id="features" class="relative py-32 px-4">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <!-- 区块头 -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 mb-4 rounded-full glass text-xs text-white/60">
        <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-aurora-violet"></span>
        核心特性
      </div>
      <h2 class="reveal text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gradient">
        为可复用的工作流而生
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal mt-4 text-white/50 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        不是又一个 AI 聊天窗。Looper 把每条流水线沉淀成可 diff、可分享、可回放的一等资产。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <!-- 卡片 1:自然语言触发(大卡) -->
      <div class="reveal-scale md:col-span-4 glass p-8 group relative overflow-hidden hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="glow-orb w-64 h-64 bg-aurora-violet/20 -top-20 -right-20 group-hover:bg-aurora-violet/40 transition-colors"></div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-aurora-violet/20 border border-aurora-violet/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7c5cff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">自然语言即触发</h3>
          <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            从聊天页说一句"跑这个",loop agent 自己挑 Skill、算图、跑到底。多步骤流水线不需要手工串接。
          </p>

          <!-- 迷你聊天演示 -->
          <div class="glass px-4 py-3 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-aurora-cyan shrink-0">you ›</span>
              <span class="text-white/80">帮我把最近 3 天的 PR 汇总一份日报</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-aurora-violet shrink-0">loop ›</span>
              <span class="text-white/50">
                <span class="text-white/80">已找到 skill: daily-report</span>
                <span class="opacity-40">· 编排 4 个节点 · </span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400">开始执行</span>
                <span class="inline-block w-1 h-3 bg-emerald-400 ml-0.5 animate-pulse align-middle"></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 卡片 2:本地运行 -->
      <div class="reveal-scale md:col-span-2 glass p-8 group relative overflow-hidden hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="glow-orb w-40 h-40 bg-aurora-cyan/20 -bottom-10 -right-10 group-hover:bg-aurora-cyan/40 transition-colors"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-aurora-cyan/20 border border-aurora-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5cf0ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 17V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10"/><line x1="2" y1="21" x2="22" y2="21"/><line x1="10" y1="9" x2="14" y2="9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">本地运行时</h3>
          <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            直接调本地 <code class="text-aurora-cyan font-mono text-xs">claude</code> CLI。<br/>
            <span class="text-white/40">零 API Key 泄漏面。离线可用。</span>
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-white/40">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span class="font-mono">no cloud dependency</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 卡片 3:DAG 一等公民 -->
      <div class="reveal-scale md:col-span-3 glass p-8 group relative overflow-hidden hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="glow-orb w-52 h-52 bg-aurora-pink/15 top-10 -left-10 group-hover:bg-aurora-pink/30 transition-colors"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-aurora-pink/20 border border-aurora-pink/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ff5cd0" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><line x1="20" y1="4" x2="8.12" y2="15.88"/><line x1="14.47" y1="14.48" x2="20" y2="20"/><line x1="8.12" y1="8.12" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">DAG 一等公民</h3>
          <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">
            工作流是数据。<span class="text-white/80">xyflow 画布 + Zod 校验 + 物化执行器</span>,diff / review / 分享都是文件级操作。
          </p>

          <div class="glass px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            <div><span class="text-aurora-pink">flow</span> <span class="text-white/40">daily-report</span> {</div>
            <div class="pl-3"><span class="text-aurora-violet">nodes</span>: 4, <span class="text-aurora-violet">edges</span>: 3</div>
            <div class="pl-3"><span class="text-aurora-cyan">schema</span>: <span class="text-emerald-400">valid ✓</span></div>
            <div>}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 卡片 4:三层组件契约 -->
      <div class="reveal-scale md:col-span-3 glass p-8 group relative overflow-hidden hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="glow-orb w-52 h-52 bg-aurora-amber/15 -bottom-10 right-10 group-hover:bg-aurora-amber/30 transition-colors"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-aurora-amber/20 border border-aurora-amber/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ffb15c" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">三层组件契约</h3>
          <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">
            L1 shadcn 原子 / L2 项目共享原语 / L3 业务 feature —— 边界写进 CLAUDE.md,AI 改动不会越权。
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="w-8 h-6 rounded-md bg-aurora-violet/20 border border-aurora-violet/30 flex items-center justify-center text-aurora-violet font-mono">L1</span>
              <span class="text-white/70 font-mono">components/ui/</span>
              <span class="text-white/30 text-[10px] ml-auto">read-only</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="w-8 h-6 rounded-md bg-aurora-cyan/20 border border-aurora-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center text-aurora-cyan font-mono">L2</span>
              <span class="text-white/70 font-mono">features/_shared/</span>
              <span class="text-white/30 text-[10px] ml-auto">shared</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="w-8 h-6 rounded-md bg-aurora-pink/20 border border-aurora-pink/30 flex items-center justify-center text-aurora-pink font-mono">L3</span>
              <span class="text-white/70 font-mono">features/&lt;domain&gt;/</span>
              <span class="text-white/30 text-[10px] ml-auto">business</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
